WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.500
You taking me to school again? -And picking you up.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.560
Daddy...

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.760
What is that, a part of some drill?

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.600
Ain't no drill.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.700
19 men attacked our country. The 12 of you will be the first ones to fight back.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.200
How do you love your family and leave them to go to war?

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.620
I have two hours, I'll be really quick. -Not a chance.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.000
Holding out is the only way I can guarantee you come back to me.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.460
Well, it's gonna be only a week.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.580
I don't care how long you're gone, as long as you come back.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.180
We got one, two, three, four!

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.980
Every step, we take he's gonna be in a minefield from a hundred different wars.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.720
Odds are, we're not all gonna make it out of this.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.320
If we don't take that city, the World Trade Center, it's just the beginning.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.000
We're teaming up the general of the Northern Alliance that we know nothing about.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.560
General, you show me exactly where we're going.

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.760
Over the mountains. We take horses.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.360
Alright, who's ridden before? Anyone?

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.840
Summer camp, when I was nine.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.620
Spring break, but I was pretty hammered

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:10.600
Does it have a name? The name?

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:12.140
Great, this will be fun.

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:16.520
We're outnumbered. Fifty thousand Taliban Al-Qaeda fighters.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:21.199
We're on our own. I can't order anyone to do this.

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.800
Do you want to surrender?

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.800
Keep your finger on the trigger.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.620
Just stay there.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:30.480
Oh, God.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.560
There's no playbook here, we have to write it ourselves.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.060
I ain't losing one man on this team.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:56.220
We're fighting with horsemen against tanks.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:03.520
The greatest weapon in history, is this.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.100
If you die, that's a letter you and your wife are gonna wish you wrote.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.400
I made you a promise. I'm coming home.

